r)---\n\n- Put both hands on a wall and your camera should \"shift\" to that direction \n\n- Go to the shop located in Forest and buy cosmetics with Bamboo \n\n- You can earn Bamboo by breaking breakables in different maps\n\n- You can access the Menu by pressing the \"X\" button on your left controller\n\n- You can chat with other people and socialize \n\n- NOTE: their is so much more coming to the game, so enjoy!", "short_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR!"}]}, "developer_name": "Killian", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iFFmMZ-ex7_ULHvjocnEnTg9T27wkMnlAtNsatqquts/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QCWf-Oik9hTnbXQimammHu8JSpttAIU9k048TvoggeY/edit?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "Killian", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/killianvr/terms-of-service", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26439756082327236"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305194_3469412889893521_7012931147052652695_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VF9Rh0aRtc8Q7kNvwHEaBNV&_n